{% doc %}
  Re-assignment on a customer reply now runs in notify_agents, before the
  reply alert, so the alert reaches the new assignee. This consumer is kept
  empty because a deploy does not delete files: an installation upgrading
  from a version that had it would otherwise keep running the old copy and
  re-assign twice.
{% enddoc %}
